# Three Settings panes overlapping, after MarkEdit's Settings shot: General in
# front at the top left, Edit behind it on the right, Themes at the bottom;
# every title bar shows. The point is a neat stack, not every control;
# overlap lets the group scale up.
# expect: General, Themes, Edit
# Settings labels are 13 pt and cannot zoom.
# legible: 24
# combine: 8c-settings-edit 8b-settings-themes 8a-settings-general
# layout: 0.66,0.4 0.47,0.71 0.33,0.33
